// category theory are references ("ca:", "ct:"), those of set theory "st:". Concepts from analysis, topology and
// polytopes without a home folder (singular cohomology, manifold, analytic space, Kähler manifold, Riemann surface,
// rational polyhedral cone, lattice polytope) and the ring of invariants have the area "basic". Schemes are separated
// where the standard texts require it; varieties are integral separated schemes of finite type over a field.
//
// Concepts with several usual equivalent definitions name the standard one (given by `uses`, `formula`, `text`) in
