// Sources: Hartshorne, Algebraic Geometry (1977); Stacks Project; Vakil, The Rising Sea (2017–2024); Lazarsfeld,
// Positivity in Algebraic Geometry (2004); Kollár and Mori, Birational Geometry of Algebraic Varieties (1998);
// Mumford, Abelian Varieties (1970). Not checked by a specialist.
